# Secrets only: full AI block (no indexing, no Agent/Tab/Inline Edit). Best-effort, not a security boundary.
# Gitignored paths are already skipped; large or generated files the agent may open go in .cursorindexingignore.

# Cloudflare local secrets
**/.dev.vars*
**/.prod.vars*
**/.staging.vars*

# Environment files (keep the *.example templates readable)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example

# Private keys & certificates
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx

# Generic credential files (mirrors the commit-secret guard)
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json

# Local agent overrides that may hold tokens or machine-specific paths
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.cursor/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
